   "source": "unverified. Thermally thick ignition t = (pi/4) k rho c (Tig-T0)^2 / q^2 with assumed k rho c ~0.5e6 W2 s/m4K2, Tig 350-450 C gives ~17-29 s at 50 kW/m2 for neat polymers (assumed inputs, textbook formula); 10 s ~ immediate ignition, 300 s = 5 min taken as a long-delay anchor"
  },
